Even with good weapons melee'ing archons is a risky venture.  My
advice is: don't bother trying to kill the Archon.  Wand of teleport
them out of the way and keep your eyes covered otherwise you can lose
valuable turns (unless you have the Eyes of the Overworld).  What can
easily happen is that once you engage them in melee they'll 'summon
nasties' and you'll be surrounded.  Even for a powerhouse hero being
surrounded can be fatal!

